#: scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8e1b15702b9d1df5ba0c163204c5e8d7f6272d2f93a0c22b176cc4fa12ca36a8
#. default-sha256: e0ee61937f38b7628914bed06c2bace32e109024ce7114de82911365921562f5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_8704C58B_AB93_4596_BBC1_66E75D5316AF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Despite his near devastation by Nellie’s news, "
"Mell’s flaxen eyes continued to wander in hopes of catching sight of the girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫Apesar de quase arrasado pelas notícias de "
"Nellie, os olhos cor de linho de Mell continuaram a vagar na esperança de avistar a garota."

#: scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8d38cbc07160c472a172732e73d83211732934e6802ae4972212aa0d77cffb3b
#. default-sha256: fe9e43e8a47ef5002196a8f8c5119b9e3bebfd43c48402170fbdc033fbf9c5cd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0630667_6F6E_43B0_886B_90F487AC79B5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. By now, it should be quite obvious to you what Mell was feeling."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Hehehe. A essa altura, deve ser bastante óbvio para você o que Mell estava sentindo."

#: scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d6ee1d4665ac126be3186d255ae1d34c101698490b0d6883b681d1c17072c5f
#. default-sha256: bbb4fb928a58527672c17e3f8bb6bbb041fc7851dfb26db417971a43d0f14608
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7868E1A0_F1CD_4C90_BC60_7BC0506FCD53"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the boy himself was having difficulty comprehending the things going through his heart."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas o próprio menino estava tendo dificuldade em compreender as coisas que passavam em seu "
"coração."

#: scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d811bbdda5089fa265f40419206e6a9f47f3ad07d5cd7adb0ad67e1057b20314
#. default-sha256: f097ece403cf9dd8d0f75484883a1d5c88e1764232d6abc3e94fcc2b9cdbfe3f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A2AA97D9_98B1_494F_A442_D2BEE9D8F412"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Emotionally, he was horribly unstable—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫like a ship without a sail."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Emocionalmente, ele era terrivelmente instável—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫como um navio sem vela."

#: scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a80b734948ef91fba5e2f332fd5f90c3fbc09c90c193923b42d43e3456a2c7e5
#. default-sha256: 07c45cc48f060e4f15ad8fad7a41cac717f2e88f7f79eb4429013b3d9841dda2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3EBFB244_2EA1_43F8_8C68_EC6138002F24"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And still, every time he spotted the White-Haired Girl, his heart would leap, his whole body "
"jitter with anxiety and excitement."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E ainda assim, toda vez que ele via a Garota de Cabelos Brancos, seu coração pulava, seu "
"corpo inteiro tremia de ansiedade e excitação."

#: scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 487efeb77dba032c67f965f7a09bebaf3c4bb6ab33087cb5b79e6c5171ab1b94
#. default-sha256: c6dc226dac4cf5cf9f2804027784807776123a1626d6bbaa413eb7d14537c970
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_880A9A00_6178_4781_9CAE_6D9A9E746C5D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He had never felt anything like this before, and as such, he struggled to keep these strange "
"emotions in check."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ele nunca havia sentido algo assim antes e, como tal, lutou para manter essas emoções "
"estranhas sob controle."

#: scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 547197f6b1059f5a9030f7dcfb78f14bbdb7d17e4a20e05181f6e794d43f02f6
#. default-sha256: bd9d91bed18276c627ba3baea4aa2e414e0e0375e1c424ef94feedb487978696
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_20A1CE6F_59BF_4E47_835D_99D923F40EB5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Whenever he saw an opportunity, Mell would speak to the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Sempre que via uma oportunidade, Mell falava com a Garota de Cabelos Brancos."

#: scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe1043322c4b5e7a557a641353e1d26980058b1f804fb8b183215dd383a255a2
#. default-sha256: cf6bee1cdba43470e1cd97bbd59738b7c0e3a43e92f0fff8ce7d9500020994f4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_09E6D0B3_1622_4C92_8AF7_B90D012C79C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And days he was unable to, he either spent in secluded silence or a distracted daze."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E nos dias em que ele não conseguia, ou passava em silêncio isolado ou em um torpor "
"distraído."

#: scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0b58c1ae73b9de71dde319e492b4cd12978692c8e369e3e44bbf77e4f39c278e
#. default-sha256: f53ae025f87f7a69832cbe1fe9472cc0a8b3330385aa010821d10ec93f255b70
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_3C246038_1524_4A89_9D60_2B80428E516B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Love is a curious thing.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It has the power to change those who experience it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O amor é uma coisa curiosa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ele tem o poder de mudar aqueles que o experimentam."

#: scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 269bb1e06dcf723afe2690dd7bf6f52aa2540247e13ac2bd7ce010adc7e2ac64
#. default-sha256: 93549339f3317c1510c8f99da7f2109b2d36ccea38607ce8b61e316d3431b825
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2A9CAE48_B5C8_4E32_B208_816384729909"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫When he did manage to approach her, he tripped over his tongue.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Again and again he "
"talked to her, and again and again he stumbled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quando ele conseguia se aproximar dela, ele tropeçava em sua língua.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫De novo e de "
"novo ele falou com ela, e de novo e de novo ele tropeçou."

#: scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c50a6a925ae10f8314918326daa4682bdde440735eb87a418205a61ccc9be071
#. default-sha256: 4d32f24675b9f873afefcdeefb41f4f109ffff8613c13e021374455b651f3d78
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EA508B09_5827_459B_B5C9_F5AF66CFEEC3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I imagine, if you were to take him to see a romance at the theatre in his present state, he "
"would cry just as much as little Nellie."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Imagino que, se você o levasse para ver um romance no teatro em seu estado atual, ele "
"choraria tanto quanto a pequena Nellie."

#: scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 27d5c0435ba14cb7c8cb9933dbeb287aa334b5358e7fc04c2dbd0ea8c2df9a2f
#. default-sha256: e280b70be8d3b6917b9ac5ceb05daaafb7a73ba7c498d8eac187ae4eb364ef45
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2AF0A793_6732_4EA1_B1BA_593CA607E647"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫We cry at tragedies because we draw parallels with our own lives.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫At least, that is "
"what I think."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Choramos nas tragédias porque traçamos paralelos com nossas próprias vidas.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Pelo "
"menos, é o que eu acho."

#: scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fe6a8a4d4cf8e5d58111ab1dee821f612017bd47ffb777c24f767e5839883a57
#. default-sha256: 899f0703715135c6ec1d5fb64d110870ddeaf18fed40238a2997b98f6436dcf2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0D975C78_27AC_402B_BC20_D506FE836692"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Great tales of romance attain true gravity with the audience only when they are personally "
"familiar with love."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Grandes contos de romance atingem a verdadeira conexão com o público apenas quando está "
"pessoalmente familiarizado com o amor."

#: scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 43460f96c06148ad60071c649a60893fa816e85772a86ecbeffb39eaf5b0d8c1
#. default-sha256: 30afd3b7060eacb992670c523131c2fa448727a75a084c98fbc9a673fd004dd2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_06EFB4F0_E9DB_4947_9E6D_EC9DD52A8803"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫In any event, the White-Haired Girl was, as a result of this, visibly perturbed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫De qualquer forma, a Garota de Cabelos Brancos ficou, como resultado disso, visivelmente "
"perturbada."

#: scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d27081da0d676f35729c43f9a7f6ed9d3d42a88ebfbf83ee3319822d61b6a054
#. default-sha256: 70936de58a6b4a2c819bad184e05a37237446b2c5747180ec287af4688c26109
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A40B3A53_2E10_4AE9_9906_5D3260514FE3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was delighted that he was being so kind to her, but confusion overpowered every other "
"emotion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela estava encantada por ele estar sendo tão gentil com ela, mas a confusão dominou todas as "
"outras emoções."

#: scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4ea2e8243326d477b71ed7d9fbde1b87044fae4cb6a5df3fc182cc377b97deb8
#. default-sha256: 02d6e626f64f86cc967c01041dda35e52e0911a5759ff5522247494d6fcaee36
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E92AD7F5_DDA7_4F31_A873_BB1B2D85E22E"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She appeared to be at a loss for what to do as he clumsily catapulted words and stares at "
"her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela parecia ficar sem saber o que fazer quando ele desajeitadamente lançava palavras e "
"olhares a ela."

#: scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dca2419b9ea896d192e5c3b22a8b1481dcd26ef107ff0d2ed80e7d73cff409fc
#. default-sha256: 361f9abd10659fc0c025f90e5ef8e0fc507e531e34a5a4bf03734094ac36a215
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_11CAD9EE_62C5_4140_B892_8B13BF254B82"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But Mell did not back down—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫though he probably knew not what ⟪k:3⟫caused⟪k:4⟫ such "
"fiery emotion to erupt from within his breast."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas Mell não recuou—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫embora ele provavelmente não sabesse ⟪k:3⟫o que⟪k:4⟫ havia "
"causado emoção tão ardente irromper de dentro de seu peito."

#: scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 410fc5649dff7bc933ba24e13b410f1afdcb438c39e6d2d00c1f347ef46f4894
#. default-sha256: ab60f612798f7cf7461e524dd17150cc4137557058234c34de8dd8d8bfed4371
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_18088729_EA9E_41E2_8B08_FD30C887B732"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫One’s first love, in particular, tends to burn like a wildfire.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Are you familiar "
"with the sensation, Master?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O primeiro amor de alguém, em particular, tende a queimar como um incêndio.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Você "
"está familiarizado com a sensação, Mestre?"

#: scenario:scenario_D35FE190_0FD7_4935_AF30_325B9163FF7B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d34184648c526a20d02d181af34e9e927c64e4b3a8823272dde1ec96bf417d7
