msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Ah..."

#: scenario:scenario_0064EE85_B55F_4F23_BFFE_56AA12E5CDD7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 53e832ce2733baf97971a2b7e21266a1aaa38deb51a76363e46390bead389184
