"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, a garota não gostava do mundo exterior.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Afinal, havia muitas coisas "
"assustadoras lá fora."

#: scenario:scenario_968DE948_AA2E_4701_A939_A2785F7CEE19
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 833fe83096515a388f51d23050743d1c1bc1bc2567ff870f157a4ce48ccd1afc
#. default-sha256: b2f506b78c175aaa4d89b56e18945fde78103827d7bf9a17438235bcab4be32e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_968DE948_AA2E_4701_A939_A2785F7CEE19"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though she may have been all alone in the mansion,⟪k:1⟫she grew comfortable with the "
"darkness in time,⟪k:2⟫so she had nothing to be afraid of."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora estivesse sozinha na mansão,⟪k:1⟫com o tempo ela se acostumou à escuridão,⟪k:2⟫"
"portanto não tinha nada a temer."

#: scenario:scenario_32F8D57D_8DD9_4FAF_9874_D376DAE271A4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cddc13ba1c7cc0521a109f8f7ca0071e0fc5a87ee8eb3b98a9dfd110a63132bc
#. default-sha256: 824960691c72584a2fb87b9256cff812903319194eaf6274d2b7e3c42eb25dba
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_32F8D57D_8DD9_4FAF_9874_D376DAE271A4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And then— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Um, ⟪k:3⟫am I doing a good job?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E então— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Hum, ⟪k:3⟫estou fazendo um bom trabalho?"

#: scenario:scenario_422A6650_3D5B_48B1_88A6_1234A389EB1A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1658d73d245d4b9a30c477c683fd79c908a093619c7f2bb16cb562fdf6120144
#. default-sha256: b497b2f9d1f66d3f7a131a08a43c373389b33083028adf880846c68b65d94975
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_422A6650_3D5B_48B1_88A6_1234A389EB1A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You’re doing fine. Keep going.⟪k:1⟫What happens next?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Você está indo bem. Continue.⟪k:1⟫O que acontece depois?"

#: scenario:scenario_2E56EF2D_57B0_499F_B806_64AAED789BC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3a1b9208028f42f2f90e4fcf0de9881973166e6efd6c794b56d96a57f7a95f22
