msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F19D5998_9D81_4477_B7BC_5C48035A7549"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫............"

#: scenario:scenario_CBCA5402_8EE5_449C_8D2C_307F99545DA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04fb27bdcc4a02371de653ddd6e67ac71f9a157b2ce90896c0f097e0e8f5ce93
#. default-sha256: 723333a46b071673ba865a02876985ff140121a4aec694282b9dfbe22c5afe2b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CBCA5402_8EE5_449C_8D2C_307F99545DA5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫So the girl decided to write letters and throw them out the window."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Então a garota decidiu escrever cartas e jogá-las pela janela."

#: scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36cdc749dbad5d76400c225408b215b78e6c1689174d35778772772f9294aaf2
#. default-sha256: 8d1faf9721adb0eace82ff1ee7c77bc8f5e8cb95c0d8c4e13f72529c6081eb03
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AF0547E0_2202_43F4_8CB8_701330F35362"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫What began as empty grasping became routine, continuing for several months until she was "
"finally ready to give up. ⟪k:1⟫But then, a beautiful white dove flew in through the window."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O que começou como um apego vazio tornou-se rotina, continuando por vários meses até que ela "
"finalmente estivesse pronta para desistir. ⟪k:1⟫Mas então, uma linda pomba branca voou pela "
"janela."

#: scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9d6b303c46bb594233769863c8e0d1cff80a48d8bd5eab0b034af46344be3cd1
#. default-sha256: 2e30116b066139b5b156508261fc04e64a7a4f874054f723889001b8250f839f
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B47548E6_0E8F_4E36_9FDC_DE0C47D1DEBC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Tied to the dove’s leg was a letter.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Her heart racing, she read "
"the words contained within.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫It seemed to have been written by a man."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Amarrado à perna da pomba estava uma carta.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Com o coração "
"acelerado, ela leu as palavras contidas.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Parecia ter sido escrito por um homem."

#: scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e6289c0a02fcc9abdde5f6fc9bc2dedafe3e3546570382de1218532e26e24d9
#. default-sha256: daa8288027c5870609549ee4c4f2824e7767881955d4c0359398f6ef9e2772bb
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5D40A3C0_D6F8_4C03_845D_28CA0562CDA8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The letter contained numerous questions for the girl.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫It also said that if she "
"attached her reply to the dove, it would bring the letter back to him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A carta continha inúmeras perguntas para a garota.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Também dizia que, se ela "
"anexasse sua resposta à pomba, isso traria a carta de volta para ele."

#: scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5ae0e2f2798e2aaace9eb8a60b8a93dcb8befa893d32766a88a4fce679eb98e1
#. default-sha256: 21f8ac28a7b21d570a98b0bcd9266833e3ff2736378f5d66bae1a2735366dbe4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88A1B4A4_544C_4C3D_9D98_E4A5630AB3FA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She was astonished, but she wrote him back anyway, taking care not to mention where she was."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela ficou perplexa, mas escreveu de volta mesmo assim, tomando cuidado para não mencionar "
"onde estava."

#: scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9b34fdab867ad2459d66e5b60a4972d65c16dcf6a4eca917bd08646fc874ff56
#. default-sha256: cbfe3d1e8aed6d820d18330a4e27280ea8cb2ecf9c890c1ac777bcfe63e72c59
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1766F330_557F_424C_8EC4_78EB2B10E402"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫After having exchanged letters a number of times, the two felt very close to one another—"
"⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫as though they had known each other for many years, despite having never met."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Depois de trocarem cartas várias vezes, os dois se sentiam muito próximos um do outro—⟪k:1⟫"
"⟪k:2⟫como se eles se conhecessem há muitos anos, apesar de nunca terem se encontrado."

#: scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e03fd387889db5d2a70cb05f32b92b043b7538e616a78e052900e8c06f1ff516
#. default-sha256: 27588fccbc096fb00d85d88c327b3b2ec399ba280571821964d196cc5ad8e19e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E1D084C7_359D_451B_BB8F_83B19A632203"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And eventually, the man..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E finalmente, o homem..."

#: scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c465e378c4406381c81099ec6c82b63d8035e0fef852f02afc3f4634b61111b4
#. default-sha256: 6eb267558706ca958e98675778c25c9a77e9aedce0ea88000850ef15aadee805
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_75974E12_E17D_44D9_BEB4_06B56661AFD3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫...Said he wanted to meet her?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...Disse que queria conhecê-la?"

#: scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2d651e9986db2805993df606a617d3388b6b7e06ae7f47acd9a23855b598ff90
#. default-sha256: fb3d2a4e50d9f1cc2c4ef5f87eaf50c933e5c69842c477e95670fdf4f21c6bbf
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F0AB2136_BF32_4302_8F9B_F4A2D8DCC0C1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Indeed."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫De fato."

#: scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 08299f773d1c17abfbc36238df06370095827636aa1b13dedd8c21287f215706
#. default-sha256: 5a5138fb43a996bc412eaf945c57f6d13773995eead9468c54648936a16a62a4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_CF942B2A_8573_4AC4_8405_038F9ECDAAF3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl was unsure what to do.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Should she tell him of how she lived?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Should she reveal where she spent her days?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A garota não sabia o que fazer.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela deveria contar a ele como ela vivia?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"Ela deveria revelar onde passava seus dias?"

#: scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2c307b04fd4bef4e6b5ae882981730a86d81fb24994b6e54ddef23859983640a
#. default-sha256: 3330477f397363ddffcda2b0bb359fc8abbf49ecda9a214ecc52657e561d61fd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F39C6EB2_6A99_4340_8145_03CBE6A4C640"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was afraid if she did, he would cease to send her letters."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela temia que, se o fizesse, ele parasse de lhe enviar cartas."

#: scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a3e3784e86620129049f7576c58f4ce5894d42b330abf64c69341794945be427
#. default-sha256: ea9ff3d308e48cf77b972b8eba4543cb0c7299240e42ca6d2f463bf7a12381a5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_EAADD9F5_3290_45CC_A62C_B6CE975B63F5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She was sure he believed her to be a young lady of noble blood..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Ela tinha certeza de que ele acreditava que era uma jovem de sangue nobre..."

#: scenario:scenario_5EF1B95C_1B1B_463B_9ABE_95212015F172
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de80a5fee8f14c0bf9a606da241ba199d968880e938f831ccb5e8cbaf8fcebd5
#. default-sha256: 1116960bab0ae6a4bc21f1427f7a9f83b725ede3d31b75e3dc8b3f7014ad0a19
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_5EF1B95C_1B1B_463B_9ABE_95212015F172"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and not a girl locked away in a house deep in the forest."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e não uma garota trancada em uma casa no meio da floresta."

#: scenario:scenario_928C667F_86C1_4B66_ADEB_36C1B7B5ACE0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 09ccf42c3c232f94c40e0a6d800f598e02edbf1737fe6730f14a6da7bcb197b3
#. default-sha256: fec02b7bb017706d455f4f01a5f2b2c54d43dcedaf7786d006df529f0d83196b
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_928C667F_86C1_4B66_ADEB_36C1B7B5ACE0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The girl could not bring herself to write a response.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫She released the dove through "
"the window with nothing attached to its leg."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫A garota não conseguiu escrever uma resposta.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Ela soltou a pomba pela janela sem "
"nada amarrado à sua perna."

#: scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e0bdf0d4a1b491d751f86c978f4bc34ed4793696c9e91e35c9bcfba494eaeb3
#. default-sha256: 37a4f879234ee8a2847c76e2f12e019f0bafcf9d6e96f7e37972586995324afd
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_FE4A3FA0_4026_4F08_BB0B_929B103BE1BA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And yet, it returned with another letter, written in the man’s familiar hand."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E, no entanto, ela voltou com outra carta, escrita com a caligrafia familiar do homem."

#: scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcadeea7b55b926f6b9642af8898a3d6de4b0eedad7963b7caf0a06ffd85ad3e
