msgctxt "scenario:scenario_486710B2_855A_4584_B7B1_3C0290E38AF5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫“You must surely have a grave reason for your silence,” it said.⟪k:1⟫“I would like to know "
"that reason, and I would like to help you.⟪k:2⟫No matter what it may be, you have my word.”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫“Você certamente deve ter um motivo grave para seu silêncio”, dizia.⟪k:1⟫“Gostaria de saber "
"esse motivo e gostaria de ajudá-la.⟪k:2⟫Não importa o que seja, você tem minha palavra.”"

#: scenario:scenario_4243FE58_99FC_4669_A108_6D091AF1DA94
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9449fecaafccccc5e2a8b7e0dae7d728cc05f55437d146ad543d87f167519e79
