msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She deliberated.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Though his letters were kind, she did not know this man.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫"
"He was from the outside.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Would he still treat her the same way when he met her?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ela deliberou a respeito.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Embora suas cartas fossem gentis, ela não conhecia esse "
"homem.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ele era de fora.⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫Ele ainda a trataria da mesma maneira quando a "
"conhecesse?"

#: scenario:scenario_8F5608BB_5BDA_4C1A_902E_F3B51D02EDA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
